  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "A table headed 'Minimum interval from the most recent dose administered'. Rows give the age-appropriate vaccine: 1-4 years, DTwP, DTaP or DT; 4-7 years, DTwP, DTaP, Td or DT; over 7 years, Td or TdaP. Columns give the dose, with the same interval for all three rows: 1st dose as early as possible; 2nd dose at least 4 weeks after the 1st; 3rd dose at least 6 months after the 2nd; 4th dose at least 1 year after the 3rd; 5th dose at least 1 year after the 4th.",
